    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yeelukha Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi yoola eNobu, ewaAhimelekhu omukuhani; naye Ahimelekhu niyeetsa okhumubukaanila Daudi, natechela, namusunjila ari Mbushiina noli wenyene, noralikhwo nende omundu yesi ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi namusunjila Ahimelekhu omukuhani mbu Omuruchi yandachile likhuwa niyamboolela ari Omundu yesi aleshe okhumanya likhuwa liosi khumakhuwa aka ekhurumila, kata aka ekhulachile tawe; nasi ndabalachile abasooliili mbu batsie habulebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano eshia oli ninashio mumukhonokwo nishiina? Umbeelesie emikaate chiraano, kata shiosi shiosi eshiliho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukuhani oyo namukalusia Daudi, naboola mbu Shikuliho omukaate kwosi mumukhono kwanje okurayahulwa ta; habula omukaate omutakatifu kuliho; abasooliili nibakhaba nibeeyahukhasiye nende abakhasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nakalusia omukuhani namusunjila ari Toto mwene, abakhasi bakhwikaliilwe, shinga olwa khubeetsanga nikhuli khuluchendo; olwa ndarulile, ebichinjilo biabasooliili biali ebitakatifu, kata olwa lurali oluchendo olutakatifu ta; kho leelo ebichinjilo biabwe shibilashila okhuba ebitakatifu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omukuhani yamuheelesia omukaate omutakatifu, okhuba shikwaliyo omukaate kwosi ta, habula Omukaate Kwokhubaho kwonye-ne, okwayinibwa imbeli wOMWAMI mbu bareho omukaate omuyiu khunyanga eya kwayinilibwamwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu undi owomubasumba baSaulo yaliho inyanga yeneyo, owali niyeekalilwayo mbu amenye imbeli w; neliiralie niye Doegi, omuEdomu, nomukhulundu wabaayi abali baSaulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi namureeba Ahimelekhu ari Ne shililikhwoho hano mumukhonokwo lifumo, kata olukanga lwosi ta? Okhuba shinzitsile nende olukanga lwanje kata ebilasanilo bianje ta, shichila emilimo chiomuruchi chienyeeshe bwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukuhani namusunjila mbu Olukanga lwaGoliatsi omuFilisiti ulia, owa weera mwibanda liaEla, lola, luli hano, lwafuumwa mushitambaya, luli inyuma wa efoti; noba niwenya okhubukula olwo, olubukule; okhuba lubulaho olundi hano ta, habula olwenolwo lwonyene. Daudi nasunga mbu Lubulaho olundi shinga olwo; umbe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi narula, niyeelukha Saulo inyanga eyo; natsia ewaAkhishi, omuruchi waGatsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abasumba baAkhishi nibamusunjila bari Uno shiali niye Daudi, omuruchi weshibala shilia? Shibayoongulilananga khuye mumishino chiabwe bari",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi yabiikha amakhuwa yaka mumwoyokwe, naria muno Akhishi omuruchi waGatsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakalukhasia ikholaye imbeli wabwe, nakwa shinga oweshiyingwa mumakhono kabwe, niyaakara khumbaho tsiomuliango, naroonyia amare khushilefushie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Akhishi nabasunjila abasumbabe ari Lole, muluutsi omundu uno nalaluushe; kho mumundeereele mbushi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie shindi nabamalalu abahela, neenyu muleerile uno okhukholanga akamalalu imbeli wanje? Uno nayeenjile munzu yanje noho?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
